{"seq":1,"slug":"metals-alloys","title":"九年级化学 — 金属与合金","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chemistry/chemistry-applications/metals-alloys","wordCount":1162,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"九年级化学-金属与合金\">九年级化学 — 金属与合金</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>金属材料是人类使用最广泛的材料之一。九年级化学要求学生掌握金属的物理性质和化学性质，了解合金的概念和金属资源的保护。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>金属</th>\n<th>化学式</th>\n<th>主要性质</th>\n<th>主要用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>铁</td>\n<td>Fe</td>\n<td>能被磁铁吸引，易生锈</td>\n<td>建筑、机械</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铜</td>\n<td>Cu</td>\n<td>导电导热性好，紫红色</td>\n<td>导线、电器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铝</td>\n<td>Al</td>\n<td>密度小，表面氧化膜</td>\n<td>航空、日用品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金</td>\n<td>Au</td>\n<td>化学性质稳定，金黄色</td>\n<td>首饰、电子</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>金属活动性顺序：K Ca Na Mg Al Zn Fe Sn Pb (H) Cu Hg Ag Pt Au，从左到右金属活动性递减。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"金属的物理性质\">金属的物理性质</h3><p>金属的共同物理性质：有金属光泽、能导电导热、有延展性。不同金属在这些性质上有差异。</p>\n<p>导电性排序：银 &gt; 铜 &gt; 铝 &gt; 铁。虽然银的导电性最好，但由于成本原因，生活中最常用的导电材料是铜和铝。</p>\n<p>密度差异：铝的密度较小（2.7g/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cm^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），适合制造轻质结构；铁的密度较大（7.87g/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cm^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），适合制造重型机械。</p>\n<h3 id=\"金属的化学性质\">金属的化学性质</h3><p>金属与氧气反应：大多数金属能与氧气反应。铝在常温下与氧气反应生成致密的氧化铝薄膜（保护作用），铁在纯氧中能燃烧但在空气中只能缓慢氧化。</p>\n<p>金属与酸反应：活动性在氢前面的金属能与稀盐酸或稀硫酸反应生成盐和氢气。例如：Zn + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>SO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{H}_2\\text{SO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>ZnSO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ZnSO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ZnSO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>↑。</p>\n<p>金属与盐溶液反应：活动性强的金属能将活动性弱的金属从其盐溶液中置换出来。例如：Fe + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CuSO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CuSO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CuSO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>FeSO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{FeSO}_4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">FeSO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> + Cu（铁钉表面出现红色物质）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"金属活动性顺序的应用\">金属活动性顺序的应用</h3><p>判断金属能否与酸反应：排在H前面的金属可以，排在H后面的不可以。</p>\n<p>判断金属能否置换盐中的金属：排在前面的金属可以置换排在后面的金属。但注意K、Ca、Na等特别活泼的金属不能从盐溶液中置换出其他金属（它们会先与水反应）。</p>\n<p>比较金属活动性：将两种金属分别放入稀盐酸中，反应更剧烈的活动性更强。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合金\">合金</h3><p>合金是在一种金属中加入其他金属或非金属熔合而成的具有金属特性的材料。合金的性质通常优于纯金属：硬度更大、熔点更低、耐腐蚀性更好。</p>\n<p>常见合金：钢（铁+碳，含碳量0.03%-2%）、不锈钢（铁+铬+镍）、黄铜（铜+锌）、青铜（铜+锡）、硬铝（铝+铜+镁+硅）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"金属资源的保护\">金属资源的保护</h3><p>金属的腐蚀（以铁的锈蚀为例）：铁与氧气和水同时接触时会生锈。防止铁制品生锈的方法：保持干燥清洁、涂油刷漆、镀层、制成合金（不锈钢）。</p>\n<p>金属资源的保护措施：防止金属腐蚀、回收利用废旧金属、合理开采矿产资源、寻找金属的替代品。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>将铁钉放入硫酸铜溶液中，观察到什么现象？写出化学方程式，分析原因。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>用金属活动性顺序判断：铜能否与稀硫酸反应？银能否从硫酸铜溶液中置换出铜？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>铝制品表面不需要特别防锈处理就很耐用，为什么？铝锅为什么不能用来盛放酸性食物？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>中考模拟：有三种金属X、Y、Z，X能与稀盐酸反应而Y和Z不能，Z能从Y的硝酸盐溶液中置换出Y。请将X、Y、Z按活动性从强到弱排列。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>金属材料的发展标志着人类文明的进步——从石器时代到青铜时代再到铁器时代。现代社会中，新型合金材料（如钛合金、形状记忆合金）在航空航天、医疗和军事领域发挥着重要作用。了解金属材料的性质和应用，有助于理解材料科学的发展方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>金属与合金是九年级化学的重要内容。掌握金属的物理性质和化学性质，熟记金属活动性顺序并能灵活应用，了解合金的概念和优点，理解金属资源保护的意义和方法。做到&quot;活动性顺序记牢、化学方程式会写、实际应用能分析&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"九年级化学 — 金属与合金","id":"九年级化学-金属与合金"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"金属的物理性质","id":"金属的物理性质"},{"level":3,"text":"金属的化学性质","id":"金属的化学性质"},{"level":3,"text":"金属活动性顺序的应用","id":"金属活动性顺序的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"合金","id":"合金"},{"level":3,"text":"金属资源的保护","id":"金属资源的保护"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"九年级化学 — 酸碱盐","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chemistry/chemical-reactions/acid-base-salt"},"next":{"title":"九年级化学 — 有机化学入门","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/chemistry/chemistry-applications/organic-chemistry-intro"}}